          The best baseboard heater for most cold rooms is a hardwired 240V convection unit sized at about 10 watts per square foot and run from a good wall thermostat. If you cannot add a circuit, a plug-in baseboard-style heater is the honest fallback. This guide covers types, sizing, wiring, thermostats and safety, then lists seven real heaters.
